## Stricter final threshold

A target passes only when:

- weighted final score is at least **8.50 / 10**;
- no individual dimension is below **8.00 / 10**;
- arithmetic and live-inventory execution close;
- official public architecture is represented;
- recognizer layers are independently built;
- high-impact traces are controlled;
- opening, heart and drydown remain plausible;
- the composition resists collapsing into a generic family accord;
- sparse or captive-heavy targets survive a separate robustness review.

